{"id":"wb-3-148","name":"飞英塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"飞英塔","text":"飞英塔位于浙江省湖州市内塔下街。始建于中国唐朝中和四年（884年）并于乾宁元年（894年）完工，最初仅有一座舍利石塔。北宋开宝年间，舍利石塔外面加盖了一座砖木塔，是为今天的飞英塔，同时是中国境内现存唯一一座塔中塔。该塔曾于南宋绍兴年间被雷击中后焚毁，并于之后重建。1929年时，飞英塔的外塔塔顶发生垮塌，后于20世纪80年代重修。1988年，飞英塔被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A3%9E%E8%8B%B1%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86856226,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856226","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/752ef2995f2b3987ee668bfa.jpg","title":"Pagoda_Feiying.jpeg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pagoda_Feiying.jpeg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/50/Pagoda_Feiying.jpeg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"井浩泽","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Pagoda Feiying in Huzhou","width":320,"height":217}}